'## 1️⃣ How To Apply

Copy the prompt above, replace the placeholders, start a **new Agent chat** in your coding assistant, and paste it.

### Prerequisite

Ensure you have:
- ✅ A locally-running mock-data app (from **Design & Build UI**)
