'## 1️⃣ How To Apply

Copy the prompt from the **Prompt** tab, start a **new Agent chat** in your coding assistant, paste it, and press Enter.

---

### Prerequisite

**Run this in your cloned Template Repository** (see Prerequisites in Step 0).

