   - `app_dir: "$APP_ROOT"` (= `<artifact_root>/<app_name>`, the top-level AppKit app dir)
   - `lakebase_host: "{lakebase_host}"`
   - `sidebar_enabled: true`
   - `navigation: "by_conversation"`
   - `identity: "OBO"`
